    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/874330/extras/252e5246583c5de4f32bbc96496e9513.poster.avif?t=1530860479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/874330/extras/252e5246583c5de4f32bbc96496e9513.webm?t=1530860479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/874330/extras/252e5246583c5de4f32bbc96496e9513.mp4?t=1530860479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br>Me And Dungeons is a first-person action game for one player. Pass through all the dungeons to prove your courage and become a real warrior.<br>Kill monsters, grab gains, and  buy weapons. You may also create your own adventure with a simple dungeon editor.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/874330/extras/b62932481f46b5aaa5fb639030e9566f.poster.avif?t=1530860479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/874330/extras/b62932481f46b5aaa5fb639030e9566f.webm?t=1530860479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/874330/extras/b62932481f46b5aaa5fb639030e9566f.mp4?t=1530860479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 15 different levels<br></li><li> Varied landscape and weather conditions<br></li><li>  Level Editor</li></ul>",
